  {
   "description": "",
   "dictionary": {
    "entries": [],
    "isArray": false,
    "variableType": 4,
    "type": "Dictionary"
   },
   "isActionBlockWorkingVar": false,
   "isLocalVar": true,
   "isSecure": false,
   "m_booleanValue": false,
   "m_decimalValue": 0.0,
   "m_intValue": 0,
   "m_name": "Help",
   "m_stringValue": "Tiny+and+powerful+calculator+with+all+operators+and+functions+allowed+in+MD+numerical+expressions.+To+simplify+writing,+some+common+functions+can+be+called+by+pressing+the+appropriate+button+of+the+<i>Custom+Keyboard</i>.\n\nThe+buttons+of+the+<i>Custom+Keyboard</i>+are+divided+into+different+areas+and+colours:\n3+control+buttons:+<i>Clear+all</i>,+<i>Validation/Exit</i>+and+<i>Backspace</i>+in+the+middle+of+the+screen;\n<font+color=#303030>███</font>+dark+grey+ones+to+enter+digits+and+specific+numbers+or+expressions,+e.g.+π+or+History+item+(see+below);\n<font+color=#605038>███</font>+brown+ones+to+enter+operators;\n<font+color=#103080>███</font>+dark+blue+ones+to+open/close+parentheses+in+an+expression;\n<font+color=#501040>███</font>+dark+purple+ones+at+the+bottom+of+the+keyboard+to+enter+the+name+of+the+more+common+MD+functions;\n<font+color=#908050>██</font>+one+light+brown+special+button+to+toggle+the+design+of+the+multiplication/division+buttons+between+(*&nbsp;⇄&nbsp;×)+and+(/&nbsp;⇄&nbsp;÷).+It+only+modifies+the+design,+not+the+operators+themselves+which+remain+\"*\"+and+\"/\".\n\nWhen+pressing+a+function+button+<font+color=#501040>███</font>+as+well+as+some+specific+operators+(<b>+^+<+>+%+</b>),+syntax+and+several+simple+explanations+(constraints,+result...)+are+shown+on+a+line+above+the+function+block.+\n\n⚠️+<i>Random()</i>+function+generates+a+new+random+number+every+time+a+button+is+pressed.\n\nIn+addition+to+the+<i>Custom+Keyboard</i>,+it+is+possible+to+type+your+own+formulas/functions+in+the+<i>Input+field</i>+at+the+top+of+the+screen.\n\nℹ️+Function+names+typed+in+the+<i>Input+field</i>+are+case+insensitive.\n\nTo+make+complex+formula+or+expression+easier+to+read+and+understand,+in+the+<i>Input+field</i>,+parentheses+\"(\"+and+\")\"+can+be+replaced+or+mixed+with+square+brackets+\"[\"+and+\"]\".\n\n⚠️+If+the+expression+typed+in+the+<i>Input+field</i>+contains+unavailable+characters+other+than+operators,+a+warning+message+will+be+displayed.+Allowed+characters+and+symbols+are:\n◼+any+digit+0→9\n◼+any+UPPER/lowercase+letter+A→z\n◼+++-+*+/+%+^+.+,+(+)+<+>+@\n\n💡+To+decode+a+system+time+integer,+prepend+it+with+the+\"@\"+character,+e.g.+\"@1234567890\"+will+return+decimal+number+193130.20090213,+i.e.+\"2009-02-13+19:31:30\".+Please+keep+in+mind+that+you+can't+make+sensible+calculations+with+this+returned+number.\n\nWhen+using+the+<i>Custom+Keyboard</i>,+the+value+of+each+button+is+not+inserted+at+the+cursor+position+but+<b>appended</b>+to+the+expression+displayed+in+the+<i>Input+field</i>.+If+the+expression+is+typed+into+the+<i>Input+field</i>,+the+decimal+result+will+be+calculated+and+displayed+when+pressing+the+\"=\"+button+(or+any+other+relevant+button).\n\nIt's+also+possible+to+permanently+store+important+or+recursive+expressions+in+a+History+and+refer+to+them+by+pressing+the+<i>History</i>+button+wherever+it's+needed.+Each+item+can+be+deleted+when+it+is+not+useful+anymore.\n\nℹ️+Every+History+item+stores+a+whole+or+partial+expression+or+formula,+not+its+result:+i.e.+\"PI*2\"+will+be+stored+and+retrieved+as+\"PI*2\"+and+not+\"6.283185307179586\"\n\nWhen+pressing+the+<i>Validation/Exit</i>+button+on+the+<i>Custom+Keyboard</i>+(with+or+without+entering+an+expression+or+a+number),+the+<i>Result+screen</i>+shows+various+<b>informative+or+selectable+items</b>:\n\n🔢+<u><i>line:</i></u>+displays+the+result+of+the+calculation+of+the+expression+previously+entered\n\n⌨+<u><i>line:</i></u>+displays+the+content+of+the+expression+previously+entered\n\n<b>EXIT+🚪☚🏃__</b>+<u><i>selectable+item:</i></u>+to+EXIT+and+close+<i>{macro_name}</i>\n\n🔘+<b>Copy+🔢+to+clipboard+📋+<u></b><i>selectable+item:</i></b></u>+to+fill+in+the+system+clipboard+with+the+displayed+result+of+the+calculation+(🔢+<i>line</i>)+to+Paste+it+into+any+other+app\n\n🔘+<b>Store+</b><⌨<b>+to+History+📃+(item+#n)+</b><u><i>selectable+item:</i></u>+to+add+the+expression+(displayed+on+⌨+<i>line</i>)+to+the+History\n\n🔘+<b>Delete+🗑️+History+items...+</b><u><i>selectable+item:</i></u>+to+delete+specific+items+from+the+History.\n\n⚙️+Show+floating+button+<u><i>selectable+item:</i></u>+to+display+a+floating+button+in+the+upper+right+corner+of+the+screen+to+easily+recall+<i>{macro_name}</i>+and+bring+it+back+to+foreground+when+another+application+has+hidden+it+(a+bit+like+clicking+on+[+|||+]+button).+You+can+drag+it+anywhere+on+the+screen+or+to+bin+to+remove+it.+It+is+automatically+removed+when+exiting+<i>{macro_name}</i>\n\n⚙️+Next+start+with+[current+expression+⌨+|+empty+field]+<u><i>selectable+item:</i></u>+to+indicate+how+to+start+next+<i>{macro_name}</i>+session.+It+toggles+between+filling+in+the+<i>Input+field</i>+of+the+<i>Custom+Keyboard</i>+with+the+last+used+expression+of+the+current+session+or+beginning+with+an+empty+field.+Scope:+permanently\n\n⚙️+Auto.+rounding:+currently+[none+|+0...16]+<u><i>selectable+item:</i></u>+to+indicate+how+to+round+the+result+of+all+further+calculations+in+this+session.+Rounding+will+occur+when+pressing+the+<i>Validation/Exit</i>+button.The+default+value+is+\"none\"+(no+rounding,+with+full+decimal+values).+Automatic+rounding+can+be+useful+when+working+with+figures+that+generally+use+a+limited+number+of+decimal+digits+(e.g.+temperature,+currencies,+distances...).+Calculation+inside+expressions+or+formulas+is+always+made+without+any+rounding.+Scope:+rounding+during+this+current+session+only,+then,+reset+to+\"none\"\nℹ️+To+round+intermediate+values+inside+an+expression,+use+<i>ROUND(val,dps)</i>.\n\n⚠️+All+calculations+are+made+with+decimal+numbers,+not+integer+ones.\n\n<small><i><b>{macro_name}</b>+v{lv=HCversion}</i>+•+©<i>DM¹¹⁴+2022-2026</i></small>",
   "m_type": 2,
   "supportsInput": true,
   "supportsOutput": true
  },
